  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Jokanur_Diggings\" title=\"Jokanur Diggings\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Jokanur_Diggings_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Jokanur Diggings (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Jokanur Diggings\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jokanur_Diggings.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Jokanur Diggings.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/32/Jokanur_Diggings.jpg/196px-Jokanur_Diggings.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/3/32/Jokanur_Diggings.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Cliffs_of_Dohjok\" title=\"Cliffs of Dohjok\">Cliffs of Dohjok</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Fahranur,_The_First_City\" title=\"Fahranur, The First City\">Fahranur, The First City</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Zehlon_Reach\" title=\"Zehlon Reach\">Zehlon Reach</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jokanur_Diggings_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Jokanur Diggings world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/16/Jokanur_Diggings_world_map.jpg/196px-Jokanur_Diggings_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"173\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/16/Jokanur_Diggings_world_map.jpg/294px-Jokanur_Diggings_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/16/Jokanur_Diggings_world_map.jpg/392px-Jokanur_Diggings_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"732\" data-file-height=\"645\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jokanur_Diggings_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Jokanur Diggings inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Jokanur_Diggings_inside.jpg/196px-Jokanur_Diggings_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Jokanur_Diggings_inside.jpg/294px-Jokanur_Diggings_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f9/Jokanur_Diggings_inside.jpg/392px-Jokanur_Diggings_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"750\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>This camp, just outside the ruins of the fabled First City of <a href=\"/wiki/Fahranur\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fahranur\">Fahranur</a>, is headquarters to the Istani Provincial Excavation Corps. Fahranur, decimated and abandoned during the <a href=\"/wiki/Scarab_Plague\" title=\"Scarab Plague\">Scarab Plague</a>, was the ancient home of the <a href=\"/wiki/Primeval_Kings\" title=\"Primeval Kings\">Primeval Kings</a> who once ruled all <a href=\"/wiki/Elona\" title=\"Elona\">Elona</a>. Some believe it also holds the key to the mystery of the Scarab Plague's origin. Superstitious fears and a bitter rivalry between the <a href=\"/index.php?title=Excavations_Corps&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Excavations Corps (page does not exist)\">Excavations Corps</a> and the <a href=\"/index.php?title=Society_of_Engineers&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Society of Engineers (page does not exist)\">Society of Engineers</a> have kept work on this important archealogical site stagnant until recently.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Jokanur Diggings</b> is the base camp of excavation operations into the old ruins of Fahranur. Diggers, engineers, and researchers have come to examine the ruins.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quests_available\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests available</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Collectors_and_crafters\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Collectors and crafters</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Merchants_and_traders\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Merchants and traders</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Trainers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trainers</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Other_services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other services</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests_available\">Quests available</span><span 