idth=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Rohmen\" title=\"Rohmen\">Rohmen</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Skill_trainer\" title=\"Skill trainer\">skill trainer</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_services\">Other services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jokanur_Diggings_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Other services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Agent\" title=\"Xunlai Agent\">Xunlai Agent</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage_upgrades\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage upgrades\">storage upgrades</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_allies\">Other allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jokanur_Diggings_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Other allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Digmaster_Gatah\" title=\"Digmaster Gatah\">Digmaster Gatah</a> (mission access)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Midauha\" title=\"Midauha\">Midauha</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Tugani\" title=\"Tugani\">Tugani</a> (mission briefing)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jokanur_Diggings_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/World_map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"World map\">world map</a> actually marks this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the <a href=\"/wiki/Jokanur_Diggings\" title=\"Jokanur Diggings\">Jokanur Diggings mission</a>.</li>\n<li>Complete exploration of this area will yield a little under 0.3% to the Elonian <a href=\"/wiki/Cartographer\" title=\"Cartographer\">Cartographer</a> title track.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Jokanur_Diggings_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The world map icon for this location interestingly shows the tomb marker of <a href=\"/wiki/Palawa_Joko\" title=\"Palawa Joko\">Palawa Joko</a> (the one found in <a href=\"/wiki/Jahai_Bluffs\" title=\"Jahai Bluffs\">Jahai Bluffs</a>) inside the scaffolding. It is unknown if there is a hidden meaning behind it or that this was a simple image reuse.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Istan#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"Istan\">Towns and outposts in Istan</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kamadan,_Jewel_of_Istan\" title=\"Kamadan, Jewel of Istan\">Kamadan, Jewel of Istan</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beknur_Harbor\" title=\"Beknur Harbor\">Beknur Harbor</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blacktide_Den_(outpost)\" title=\"Blacktide Den (outpost)\">Blacktide Den</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chahbek_Village_(outpost)\" title=\"Chahbek Village (outpost)\">Chahbek Village</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Champion%27s_Dawn\" title=\"Champion&#39;s Dawn\">Champion's Dawn</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consulate_Docks_(outpost)\" title=\"Consulate Docks (outpost)\">Consulate Docks</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Jokanur Diggings</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kodlonu_Hamlet\" title=\"Kodlonu Hamlet\">Kodlonu Hamlet</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunspear_Arena_(outpost)\" title=\"Sunspear Arena (outpost)\">Sunspear Arena</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunspear_Great_Hall\" title=\"Sunspear Great Hall\">Sunspear Great Hall</a> •</span> <span style=\"